# Wrangler builds the image with the Dockerfile piped on stdin (`-f -`), so no
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore applies and only this root file is read.
# A `docker build -f container/Dockerfile` build prefers container/Dockerfile.dockerignore
# instead: keep the patterns there in sync with this file.
# Send only what the image copies: container/ sources and src/worker/lib/redact.ts.
*
!container/
!src/
container/test/
container/e2e/
container/tsconfig.json
src/*
!src/worker/
src/worker/*
!src/worker/lib/
src/worker/lib/*
!src/worker/lib/redact.ts
